sequenceDiagram
    participant Edge as Edge (Tracker + SlotMapper)
    participant Q as SQLite Queue
    participant Ingest as Backend Ingest API
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ Event Bus
    participant Hist as ParkingHistory / Vehicle Service
    participant Notif as Notification Service
    participant WS as STOMP/WebSocket + Push

    Edge->>Edge: detect slot change for same identity (track_id or reconciled plate)
    Edge->>Q: enqueue VehicleRelocated candidate (event_id, occurred_at)
    Q->>Ingest: POST /api/v1/events (X-Gate-Key, idempotency by event_id)
    Ingest->>Ingest: validate + dedup by event_id
    Ingest->>Outbox: write ParkingEvent row + outbox row (single transaction)
    Outbox->>Bus: relay VehicleRelocated
    Bus->>Hist: consume VehicleRelocated
    Hist->>Hist: update Vehicle.current_slot_id
    Hist->>Hist: insert ParkingHistory(old_slot, new_slot)
    Bus->>Notif: consume VehicleRelocated
    Notif->>Notif: build "vehicle moved" notification (see 19_Notification)
    Notif->>WS: push to tenant/site subscribers (STOMP + mobile push)
    Ingest-->>Q: 200 OK ack
